- [high_performance.yaml](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/config/high_performance.yaml) - 高性能配置
- [laser_avoidance_params.yaml](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/config/laser_avoidance_params.yaml) - 激光避障参数
- [qos_profiles.py](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/bottle_detection_ros2/core/qos_profiles.py) - QoS配置

### 启动文件
- [agrisage_with_lidar.launch.py](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/launch/agrisage_with_lidar.launch.py) - 主系统启动
- [bottle_detection_async.launch.py](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/launch/bottle_detection_async.launch.py) - 异步检测启动
- [slam_mapping.launch.py](mdc:robot_ROS2-6_9/src/bottle_detection_ros2/launch/slam_mapping.launch.py) - SLAM映射启动

